{"id": "Dc6IUUVvmUE", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"PROMPT\" to get the World’s Biggest AI Prompt Library.\n\nSomeone just built the world's biggest prompt library.\n\nThey made it completely free and open source.\n\nIt's called prompts.chat.\n\nIt has over ten thousand prompts for writing, coding, images, video, and research.\n\nPlus ready made skills and workflows for pretty much any task you can think of.\n\nThat covers writers, developers, designers, and researchers all in one single place.\n\nAnd the best part is you can plug the whole library straight into your Claude Code as an MCP server.\n\nSo your agent automatically picks the best prompt for whatever task you're working on.\n\nYou never have to copy paste anything again.\n\nThink of it like giving your agent its own personal library card, it grabs exactly what it needs, right when it needs it.\n\nNo more digging through old notes or bookmarked tweets trying to remember which prompt actually worked last time.\n\nEverything just lives in one place, ready whenever your agent needs it.\n\nWhether you're writing a blog post, debugging code, or generating an image, there's already a tested prompt waiting for you.\n\n#promptlibrary #aiprompting #githubrepo #promptschat #opensourceai", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1788617020, "like_count": 6993, "comment_count": 12728, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1607993364452412a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.713, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMSS6aO6P96thbpHz9ohsOX9V6uDOjoYQQ790OratTpnu9aSWtHBias9de9ffqg9knep5Dk0z-_ZEJqaA8OSVDLVPSYoOgyR2WekLk.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=Ado2TGOsyIrZ2B-3xWyijCJtS6l4E6MV94yuFFPMc60IRRuvWUEKX6yqCKEjzUC-ClU&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net